# The tracker's own data, if anybody points TASKTRACKER_HOME at the checkout
# while developing. The real store lives under ~/.claude/tasktracker and is
# never inside this tree, but a stray tasks.db committed once is a stray
# tasks.db in the history for good.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

